    "overview": "<p>Dune buggies have been a mainstay of militias for countless centuries. Apart from jeeps, few other vehicle classes are more reliable and sturdy in off-road battle. Outfitted with an open gunner's station, dune buggies are very effective against other light vehicles and infantry, especially in the shifting sands of a desert or beachfront terrain. Not only pirate bands refit civilian vehicles into fighting machines.</p>",
